.TH ceam-util-system-file-share 1  "file-share " 
.SH NAME
ceam\-util\-system\-file\-share \- Samba file sharing management
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBceam\-util system file\-share\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Samba file sharing management
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ceam\-util\-system\-file\-share\-enable(1)
enable service autostart and start it
.TP
ceam\-util\-system\-file\-share\-disable(1)
